  <h2><a href="/web/20110525013939/http://roblox.zendesk.com/forums">Answers</a><span class="delim">/</span><a href="/web/20110525013939/http://roblox.zendesk.com/forums/285061-your-account">Your Account</a></h2>

  <div class="frame">
    <div class="entry nobottom" style="padding-bottom:0;">
      <h3 class="entry-title">I forgot my password!</h3>
      <p class="sub">YumYumCheerios Jul-23 2010</p>
      <div class="user_formatted" style="margin-top:35px;">
        <p>Please try using the "Forgot your password?" link below the Login  button. This will send an email to the email address on your account  that will allow you to reset your password. If you do not appear to  receive the email, please be sure to check your junk/spam folders.<br/><br/>If you know your password is correct but you still can't log in, try the steps on this help page:<br/><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20110525013939/https://www.roblox.com/Login/Help.aspx">https://www.roblox.com/Login/Help.aspx</a><br/><br/>However,  if the "Forgot your password?" link does not work and you are a member  of Builders Club (or have ever bought anything from ROBLOX) we can reset  the password for you. You will need to verify ownership of the account  by emailing us to <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20110525013939/mailto:info@roblox.com">info@roblox.com</a> from the billing email address. If you  did not provide an email address or are not a member of Builders Club,  we're sorry but there's nothing further we can do for you, as we have no  way of verifying ownership of the account.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
